    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ooo-ooo Aaaah-Aaaah! <i>Monkey Fight Championship</i> is da big fight game, where strong monkey warriors go <i>BAM BAM</i> in wild arenas! Me and other funky monkeys punch, kick, jump and smash real hard \u2014 we no play, we FIGHT for glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599740/extras/Ultimate_ability.png?t=1747321538\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each monkey got special powa, like fronta kick make enemies fly, big slam make ground go <i>BOOM</i>, or robot monkey shoot fire fists! You pick da monkey, you fight da fight \u2014 only da strongest monkey win! Ooo-aaah!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ooo-ooo Aaaah-Aaaah! <i>Monkey Fight Championship</i> is da big fight game, where strong monkey warriors go <i>BAM BAM</i> in wild arenas! Me and other funky monkeys punch, kick, jump and smash real hard \u2014 we no play, we FIGHT for glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599740/extras/Ultimate_ability.png?t=1747321538\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each monkey got special powa, like fronta kick make enemies fly, big slam make ground go <i>BOOM</i>, or robot monkey shoot fire fists! You pick da monkey, you fight da fight \u2014 only da strongest monkey win! Ooo-aaah!</p>",
